{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-complete-man","title":"完整的人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-complete-man","wordCount":1621,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章对苏轼作出综合评价。&quot;完整的人&quot;，是对苏轼崇高地位最贴切的评价——他以全面的成就、圆融的人格、真实的性情，集才华与人格、入世与超脱、深刻与亲切、崇高与温暖于一体，是中国文化史上一位罕见的&quot;完整的人&quot;。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其卓越成就与完美人格，又客观正视围绕其政治生涯与思想的种种探讨，以辩证的眼光，认识这位不朽的文化巨人。</p>\n"}